        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: NRG Energy, Raymond James Financial\n- Places: West Windsor Township, New Jersey; Houston, Texas; NRG Park\n- Events: Houston Auto Show\n\nFacts:\n- NRG Energy, Inc. is a large American energy company with dual headquarters in West Windsor Township, New Jersey, and Houston, Texas.\n- Raymond James Financial is an American diversified holding company that provides financial services through subsidiaries, including investment and financial planning, investment banking, and asset management.\n- NRG Park, formerly called Reliant Park and Astrodomain, is a complex in Houston, Texas, named after NRG Energy.\n- The Houston Auto Show is an annual auto show held in January at NRG Park.",
